# Tier I — io_uring proof, capital-city outgoing dump
# Physical: P+O bound scan of wdt:P31 wd:Q5119 (capital city), then
# S bound SPO of all outgoing ?p ?o. LIMIT 50000.
# CONSTRUCT emits s, p, and o. The class is smaller than humans or
# films, so serialize is not the main cost. Unique object IDs stay high.
# Expected if lookupBatch+io_uring is live: pread64 and syscr fall,
# io_uring_enter rises, elapsed falls.
PREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>
PREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>

CONSTRUCT { ?s ?p ?o }
WHERE {
  ?s wdt:P31 wd:Q5119 ;
     ?p ?o .
}
LIMIT 50000

